            <title>[IGNITE-10756] MVCC: Query trackers are not released sometimes </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10756</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Sometimes query trackers are not released when error occurs during iterating over &lt;tt&gt;QueryCursor&lt;/tt&gt;. It may be already fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10448&quot; title=&quot;MVCC: NPE on data page eviction.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10448&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10448&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Need to check.&lt;br/&gt;
